WEBVTT

00:00:28.329 --> 00:00:30.538
The answer is miscommunication,

00:00:30.579 --> 00:00:33.162
and in some form or another,
we’ve all experienced it.

00:00:33.371 --> 00:00:34.996
It can lead to confusion,

00:00:35.037 --> 00:00:36.079
animosity,

00:00:36.121 --> 00:00:37.496
misunderstanding,

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:41.787
or even crashing a multimillion
dollar probe into the surface of Mars.

00:00:42.037 --> 00:00:44.787
The fact is even when face-to-face
with another person,

00:00:44.829 --> 00:00:47.412
in the very same room,
and speaking the same language,

00:00:47.454 --> 00:00:50.871
human communication is incredibly complex.

00:00:52.454 --> 00:00:53.787
But the good news is

00:00:53.829 --> 00:00:57.037
that a basic understanding
of what happens when we communicate

00:00:57.079 --> 00:00:59.996
can help us prevent miscommunication.